parameters.text:
A customer is a high-risk churn threat with a predicted churn probability of {{ $json.churn_probability }}.

Customer Details:
- ID: {{ $('1. Load Sample Data').item.json.CustomerID }}
- Plan: {{ $('1. Load Sample Data').item.json.PlanLevel }}
- Original Ticket: "{{ $('1. Load Sample Data').item.json.SupportTicketText }}"

Your task is to act as an expert Customer Success Manager. Draft a concise, empathetic, and professional email to this customer. The goal is to de-escalate, acknowledge their potential issue, and offer a clear path to resolution by inviting them to a priority support call. Do not offer a discount. Output only the email text.

parameters.jsCode:
const intervention = $json.text;
const customer = $('1. Load Sample Data').item.json.CustomerID;
const churnProb = $('2. Risk Scoring Agent (Python ML Model)').item.json.churn_probability;

const crmTask = {
  taskType: 'URGENT_FOLLOW_UP',
  customerId: customer,
  title: `High-Risk Churn Alert for ${customer}`,
  description: `Customer has a churn probability of ${(churnProb * 100).toFixed(2)}%. An automated intervention email has been designed. Please review and contact customer immediately.`,
  suggestedEmail: intervention
};

return crmTask;
